WEBVTT

00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:01.349
Why did I rent it?

00:00:01.359 --> 00:00:02.349
I wanted to try it.

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:03.829
I wanted to make sure we liked it.

00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:08.479
I love that I can have my side cold,
my wife can have her side hot.

00:00:08.779 --> 00:00:12.169
It's absolutely amazing,
highly recommended.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:14.929
Uh, I also liked the upgradeability.

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:19.169
Uh, I like the concept that
when a new model comes out,

00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:20.439
I can upgrade
